1
00:00:00,990 --> 00:00:06,930
Zankoku na tenshi no you ni

2
00:00:00,990 --> 00:00:06,930
Just like the cruel angel

3
00:00:06,930 --> 00:00:14,590
Shounen yo shinwa ni nare

4
00:00:06,930 --> 00:00:14,590
Young boy, become a legend

5
00:00:18,990 --> 00:00:22,410
2D4U PRESENTS:

6
00:00:22,770 --> 00:00:25,810
Aoi kaze ga ima

7
00:00:22,770 --> 00:00:25,810
Even though the untested breeze...

8
00:00:25,810 --> 00:00:29,510
mune no doa o tataitemo

9
00:00:25,810 --> 00:00:29,510
...taps at the door to your heart

10
00:00:29,510 --> 00:00:36,970
Watashi dake o tada mitsumete hohoenderu anata

11
00:00:29,510 --> 00:00:36,970
You just look solely at me and smile

12
00:00:37,560 --> 00:00:44,500
Sotto fureru mono motomeru koto ni muchuu de

13
00:00:37,560 --> 00:00:44,500
So intent on seeking out that gentle touch

14
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:51,400
Unmei sae mada shiranai itaike na hitomi

15
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:51,400
Such innocent eyes, still ignorant of their destiny

16
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:55,750
Dakedo itsuka kizuku deshou

17
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:55,750
But someday, you are sure to realize...

18
00:00:55,750 --> 00:00:58,340
sono senaka ni wa

19
00:00:55,750 --> 00:00:58,340
...that upon your back

20
00:00:59,510 --> 00:01:02,960
Haruka mirai mezasu tame

21
00:00:59,510 --> 00:01:02,960
You have the wings with which to fly...

22
00:01:02,960 --> 00:01:06,310
no hane ga aru koto

23
00:01:02,960 --> 00:01:06,310
...towards the distant future

24
00:01:06,990 --> 00:01:10,690
Zankoku na tenshi no teeze

25
00:01:06,990 --> 00:01:10,690
The cruel angel's thesis

26
00:01:10,690 --> 00:01:14,430
Madobe kara yagate tobidatsu

27
00:01:10,690 --> 00:01:14,430
Soon, you will take flight from the windowsill

28
00:01:14,430 --> 00:01:18,200
Hotobashiru atsui patosu de

29
00:01:14,430 --> 00:01:18,200
With your torrent of ardent pathos

30
00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:21,900
Omoide o uragiru nara

31
00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:21,900
If you are to betray our memories

32
00:01:21,900 --> 00:01:25,540
Kono sora o daite kagayaku

33
00:01:21,900 --> 00:01:25,540
You, who embrace these heavens and shine

34
00:01:25,540 --> 00:01:29,270
Shounen yo shinwa ni nare

35
00:01:25,540 --> 00:01:29,270
Young boy, become a legend

36
00:01:31,360 --> 00:01:33,110
Hey, have you seen her yet?

37
00:01:33,110 --> 00:01:34,190
Oh, yeah! Yeah!

38
00:01:34,190 --> 00:01:35,240
Seen who?

39
00:01:35,240 --> 00:01:37,400
You dork, you haven't seen
the foreign girl yet?

40
00:01:37,400 --> 00:01:38,530
Foreign girl?

41
00:01:38,530 --> 00:01:40,660
Yeah, she's in 8th grade, Class A.

42
00:01:40,660 --> 00:01:43,790
She just transferred here last week.

43
00:01:44,500 --> 00:01:46,460
She's hot!

44
00:01:47,410 --> 00:01:50,210
Great Deal
30 yen per picture

45
00:01:47,410 --> 00:01:50,210
Asuka Langley Sohryu
Photo Order Sheet

46
00:01:47,670 --> 00:01:50,750
Her name's Asuka Langley Sohryu,
did you know that?

47
00:01:50,750 --> 00:01:53,250
She's seriously cute.

48
00:01:53,250 --> 00:01:55,090
Since she was raised over there
but born here,

49
00:01:55,090 --> 00:01:56,840
do you think she matured early?

50
00:01:56,840 --> 00:01:58,380
Don't be stupid!

51
00:01:58,380 --> 00:02:00,850
I bet she broke up in Germany,
and she's here in a foreign land

52
00:02:00,850 --> 00:02:04,100
with a heart that can't be mended.

53
00:02:03,720 --> 00:02:05,930
To Miss Sohryu

54
00:02:07,810 --> 00:02:09,980
Oh, man...

55
00:02:09,980 --> 00:02:12,480
Everybody and their brother!

56
00:02:12,480 --> 00:02:15,400
Asuka! Asuka!

57
00:02:15,400 --> 00:02:16,650
They're just ignorant.

58
00:02:16,650 --> 00:02:18,570
Thank you, come again.

59
00:02:19,280 --> 00:02:23,030
At least the pictures don't
reveal her personality.

60
00:02:23,490 --> 00:02:25,290
Hello!

61
00:02:25,290 --> 00:02:26,660
Shinji!

62
00:02:26,660 --> 00:02:28,330
Guten Morgen!

63
00:02:28,330 --> 00:02:30,170
Guten morgen...

64
00:02:30,170 --> 00:02:35,420
Hey, why so gloomy this early?
This is the gorgeous Asuka greeting you!

65
00:02:35,420 --> 00:02:38,260
Look a little more happy about it!

66
00:02:38,760 --> 00:02:42,050
So the other one's here too, isn't she?

67
00:02:42,050 --> 00:02:43,050
Who's that?

68
00:02:43,050 --> 00:02:46,890
What are you, stupid? I'm talking about
the First Child, of course!

69
00:02:46,890 --> 00:02:48,850
Oh, if it's Ayanami...

70
00:02:58,690 --> 00:03:00,610
Hello!

71
00:03:00,610 --> 00:03:04,070
You must be Rei Ayanami,
the pilot of the prototype.

72
00:03:06,290 --> 00:03:09,370
I'm Asuka! Asuka Langley Sohryu.

73
00:03:09,370 --> 00:03:13,000
I'm the pilot of Eva Unit 02.
Let's be good friends!

74
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:14,080
Why?

75
00:03:14,080 --> 00:03:17,800
Because it'd be convenient, in lots of ways.

76
00:03:17,800 --> 00:03:20,170
If I'm ordered to, I will.

77
00:03:20,170 --> 00:03:21,630
Talk about odd.

78
00:03:21,630 --> 00:03:25,720
I'll say. Are only weirdos chosen
to be pilots?

79
00:03:35,610 --> 00:03:37,070
Have you lost some weight?

80
00:03:37,070 --> 00:03:38,190
Have I?

81
00:03:38,190 --> 00:03:40,110
You must be enduring an unrequited love.

82
00:03:40,110 --> 00:03:43,360
How did you know?

83
00:03:45,320 --> 00:03:46,450
Because...

84
00:03:46,450 --> 00:03:48,990
"A woman with a mole in
the pathway of her tears

85
00:03:48,990 --> 00:03:51,540
is destined to a life full of them."

86
00:03:51,540 --> 00:03:54,540
If you're trying to put a move on me,
I'm afraid you can't.

87
00:03:54,540 --> 00:03:56,880
There's a very scary lady watching us.

88
00:04:00,800 --> 00:04:02,760
Long time no see, Kaji.

89
00:04:02,760 --> 00:04:04,430
It's been a while.

90
00:04:04,430 --> 00:04:07,470
You're actually pretty careless,
aren't you, Kaji?

91
00:04:07,470 --> 00:04:09,890
He's as much of an idiot as ever.

92
00:04:09,890 --> 00:04:13,730
If you're done handing over Unit 02,
hurry up and leave!

93
00:04:13,730 --> 00:04:17,610
I just received orders this morning
that I'll be staying here on loan.

94
00:04:17,610 --> 00:04:20,940
So the three of us can hang out again,
just like we used to.

95
00:04:20,940 --> 00:04:22,860
Who'd hang out with YOU?

96
00:04:23,820 --> 00:04:25,660
Enemy attack?!

97
00:04:25,660 --> 00:04:28,330
We just got this report from the
patrolling battlecruiser Haruna.

98
00:04:28,330 --> 00:04:32,250
"Huge submerged object detected off
Ki'i peninsula. Sending data."

99
00:04:32,580 --> 00:04:34,790
The data has been collated.

100
00:04:34,790 --> 00:04:37,080
Wavelength pattern Blue.
Confirmed to be an Angel.

101
00:04:37,080 --> 00:04:39,210
All personnel, go to
battle stations, Level One.

102
00:04:39,250 --> 00:04:42,720
EPISODE 09
MOMENT AND
HEART TOGETHER

103
00:04:44,510 --> 00:04:50,100
The recent battle severely damaged
the intercept system of New Tokyo-3.

104
00:04:50,100 --> 00:04:53,180
We've only effected 26 percent
of the repairs at present.

105
00:04:53,180 --> 00:04:56,190
And our operational capability for
actual combat is virtually nil.

106
00:04:56,560 --> 00:04:59,980
Therefore, we'll crush the target
in a single blow

107
00:04:59,980 --> 00:05:02,070
at the water's edge, right
before it makes landfall!

108
00:05:02,070 --> 00:05:06,110
Units 01 and 02 will mount an attack
in a series of waves.

109
00:05:06,110 --> 00:05:07,490
In other words, close in and take turns.

110
00:05:07,490 --> 00:05:08,660
Roger.

111
00:05:08,660 --> 00:05:11,910
This sucks. It's my Japanese debut.

112
00:05:11,910 --> 00:05:14,580
Why won't she let me take it out myself?

113
00:05:15,210 --> 00:05:18,040
It can't be helped. That's the strategy.

114
00:05:18,040 --> 00:05:22,460
Let me tell you something,
just don't get in my way!

115
00:05:24,050 --> 00:05:26,590
Why did someone like him get chosen
to be a pilot?

116
00:05:39,810 --> 00:05:43,440
Two against one isn't a fair fight.
I don't like it. Not my style.

117
00:05:44,280 --> 00:05:49,160
We don't have the luxury of choosing
our means to survive.

118
00:05:52,530 --> 00:05:53,120
Here it comes!

119
00:05:59,710 --> 00:06:01,540
Commence attack!

120
00:06:01,540 --> 00:06:04,050
Okay, I'll go first! Back me up!

121
00:06:04,050 --> 00:06:05,380
Back you up?

122
00:06:05,380 --> 00:06:06,760
Ladies first!

123
00:06:06,760 --> 00:06:09,720
Sheesh, don't order me around!
You're the new one!

124
00:06:14,850 --> 00:06:15,430
I can take him!

125
00:06:29,610 --> 00:06:30,360
Amazing!

126
00:06:33,280 --> 00:06:35,740
Well, Third Child?!

127
00:06:35,740 --> 00:06:38,290
A fight should be elegant and without waste.

128
00:06:50,630 --> 00:06:52,510
That's cheating!

129
00:06:57,930 --> 00:07:01,020
Today, at 10:58:15 AM,

130
00:07:01,020 --> 00:07:04,570
Unit 01 was attacked by Target A,

131
00:07:04,570 --> 00:07:07,730
which split from the target
submerged 2 km off Suruga Bay.

132
00:07:07,730 --> 00:07:12,110
At the same time, plus 20 seconds,
Unit 02 was halted by Target B.

133
00:07:12,110 --> 00:07:15,280
We have a comment from
the chair of Project E.

134
00:07:15,280 --> 00:07:16,450
This is pathetic.

135
00:07:16,450 --> 00:07:20,620
This is all your fault! You totally
screwed up my debut battle!

136
00:07:20,620 --> 00:07:21,960
What are you talking about?

137
00:07:21,960 --> 00:07:24,590
You're the one who did something stupid!

138
00:07:24,590 --> 00:07:28,130
Stupid?! Where does a lamebrain like you
get off calling me that?

139
00:07:28,130 --> 00:07:29,590
That's just shameless!

140
00:07:29,590 --> 00:07:33,140
What do you mean?! We got in this trouble
because you were in such a rush to defeat it!

141
00:07:33,140 --> 00:07:36,600
What was that? You look like a drowned rat!
How lame!

142
00:07:34,550 --> 00:07:38,810
At 11:03 AM, NERV abandoned the operation

143
00:07:36,600 --> 00:07:39,640
Like you can talk!

144
00:07:39,640 --> 00:07:42,770
And transferred command to
the UN Secondary Force.

145
00:07:42,770 --> 00:07:45,310
You've humiliated us.

146
00:07:45,310 --> 00:07:48,940
At 11:05 AM, the UN forces made
an attack with an N2 mine.

147
00:07:49,530 --> 00:07:52,450
We'll have to re-draw the map again.

148
00:07:52,490 --> 00:07:55,120
7th Angel A/B

149
00:07:52,490 --> 00:07:55,990
They succeeded in burning off 28%
of the target's structural substance.

150
00:07:55,200 --> 00:07:55,990
Did they kill it?

151
00:07:55,240 --> 00:07:58,950
7th Angel B

152
00:07:55,240 --> 00:07:58,950
7th Angel A

153
00:07:55,240 --> 00:07:58,950
Report:
Department of Investigation Division 2,
Nerv Scientific Investigation Branch

154
00:07:55,990 --> 00:07:59,500
This is merely temporary relief.
A second attack is a matter of time.

155
00:07:59,500 --> 00:08:03,500
At least it bought us time to regroup,
so we got something out of it.

156
00:08:03,500 --> 00:08:05,500
Listen up, you two.

157
00:08:05,500 --> 00:08:08,090
Do you know what your job is?

158
00:08:08,090 --> 00:08:09,210
Piloting Eva.

159
00:08:09,210 --> 00:08:11,510
No! Your job is to defeat the Angels.

160
00:08:11,510 --> 00:08:15,590
Nerv does not exist to make
grotesque displays like this.

161
00:08:15,590 --> 00:08:17,850
Therefore, you two must cooperate.

162
00:08:17,850 --> 00:08:19,720
Why should we?!

163
00:08:19,720 --> 00:08:21,310
Enough already.

164
00:08:23,350 --> 00:08:25,850
Why's everyone so touchy here?

165
00:08:25,850 --> 00:08:28,440
It's because adults don't like
to be embarrassed.

166
00:08:28,440 --> 00:08:31,030
Where's Miss Misato?

167
00:08:31,030 --> 00:08:35,110
Cleaning things up. The person in charge
exists to take responsibility.

168
00:08:36,450 --> 00:08:39,700
Here are the internal protests
and damage reports,

169
00:08:39,700 --> 00:08:42,500
and this is a bill from the UN,

170
00:08:42,500 --> 00:08:44,750
and here you have complaints from
the PR department as well.

171
00:08:45,370 --> 00:08:47,170
Make sure you read them all.

172
00:08:47,170 --> 00:08:49,590
I don't have to read them
to know what they say.

173
00:08:49,590 --> 00:08:52,210
"If you're going to fight, do it here," right?

174
00:08:52,210 --> 00:08:53,550
How insightful.

175
00:08:53,550 --> 00:08:57,010
I don't need them to tell me. I'll do it here
as soon as the topside gets cleaned up.

176
00:08:57,390 --> 00:09:00,220
I'll destroy the Angels without fail.

177
00:09:00,220 --> 00:09:02,350
The Vice Commander is livid.

178
00:09:02,350 --> 00:09:06,190
You'll almost certainly be demoted
if you embarrass him again.

179
00:09:06,190 --> 00:09:09,820
It was a silver lining that
Commander Ikari wasn't here.

180
00:09:09,820 --> 00:09:13,360
If he'd been here, you'd have been fired
before he ever saw these.

181
00:09:13,360 --> 00:09:17,110
So, you brought me an idea
to help save my job, right?

182
00:09:17,450 --> 00:09:19,240
Just one.

183
00:09:19,240 --> 00:09:21,330
You're amazing, Dr. Ritsuko Akagi.

184
00:09:21,330 --> 00:09:24,160
It's good to have kind friends from way back.

185
00:09:24,160 --> 00:09:28,290
Unfortunately, I'm not the one who will be
bailing out my old friend.

186
00:09:28,290 --> 00:09:30,500
This is Kaji's idea.

187
00:09:28,580 --> 00:09:30,000
To my honey

188
00:09:30,500 --> 00:09:32,090
Kaji's?

189
00:09:45,480 --> 00:09:51,360
I'm home! Not that anyone's here,
of course, but...

190
00:09:53,150 --> 00:09:54,440
What is this?!

191
00:09:54,440 --> 00:09:56,030
Don't be so rude!

192
00:09:56,030 --> 00:09:57,990
Those are my personal belongings!

193
00:09:57,990 --> 00:10:00,320
What are you doing here?!

194
00:10:01,530 --> 00:10:03,160
It's more like, why are you still here?

195
00:10:03,160 --> 00:10:04,620
Still here?

196
00:10:05,620 --> 00:10:07,540
You've been dumped for the new model!

197
00:10:09,120 --> 00:10:11,460
Misato will be living with me.

198
00:10:11,460 --> 00:10:15,630
Well, it's the logical choice when you
consider whose abilities are superior.

199
00:10:15,630 --> 00:10:18,090
Although honestly, I'd rather live with Mr. Kaji.

200
00:10:18,090 --> 00:10:21,760
But why are Japanese rooms
so small anyway?

201
00:10:22,050 --> 00:10:24,560
Not even half of my stuff fits!

202
00:10:25,100 --> 00:10:27,020
Shin's Ro

203
00:10:27,230 --> 00:10:31,900
On top of which, why don't the Japanese
have any sense of privacy?

204
00:10:31,900 --> 00:10:35,650
How can they live in rooms without locks?
Unbelievable!

205
00:10:35,650 --> 00:10:37,150
It's because the Japanese way

206
00:10:37,150 --> 00:10:39,490
is to consider the priorities and needs
of others before one's own.

207
00:10:39,490 --> 00:10:40,570
Miss Misato!

208
00:10:40,570 --> 00:10:43,950
Welcome home! Looks like you're
getting along well already.

209
00:10:43,950 --> 00:10:45,200
What do you mean?

210
00:10:45,200 --> 00:10:47,120
This is all preparation for the next operation.

211
00:10:47,120 --> 00:10:48,460
How's that?

212
00:10:49,040 --> 00:10:51,540
The seventh Angel has one
and only one weakness!

213
00:10:51,540 --> 00:10:55,250
A simultaneous two-point attack
on each target's core

214
00:10:55,250 --> 00:10:56,090
while its components are separated.

215
00:10:57,210 --> 00:11:01,720
In other words, an attack by two Evas
with perfectly synchronized timing.

216
00:11:02,090 --> 00:11:06,430
For that, we'll need cooperation and
perfect coordination from you two.

217
00:11:06,640 --> 00:11:10,730
Therefore, I'm having you two live together.

218
00:11:12,900 --> 00:11:13,860
No way!

219
00:11:13,860 --> 00:11:16,860
It's always been said that boys and girls
shouldn't sleep together after age seven!

220
00:11:16,860 --> 00:11:19,190
The Angel is currently restoring itself.

221
00:11:19,190 --> 00:11:21,490
It will begin its second assault in six days,
so there's no time.

222
00:11:21,490 --> 00:11:23,820
But that's crazy!

223
00:11:24,570 --> 00:11:27,580
So here's how to make the crazy possible.

224
00:11:27,580 --> 00:11:30,330
In order for you to master perfect unison,

225
00:11:30,330 --> 00:11:32,830
you'll memorize the attack pattern that's been
arranged to this music.

226
00:11:33,210 --> 00:11:36,040
In six days, as soon as possible.

227
00:11:47,010 --> 00:11:49,770
But I wonder what's happened to Shinji.

228
00:11:49,770 --> 00:11:52,100
He's been gone three days, right?

229
00:11:55,810 --> 00:11:57,190
Hey, there's the class rep.

230
00:11:57,190 --> 00:11:58,780
Two of the three stooges.

231
00:11:58,780 --> 00:12:01,110
Why are you here?

232
00:12:01,110 --> 00:12:04,410
To see how Miss Sohryu is doing.
What about you two?

233
00:12:04,410 --> 00:12:06,740
To see how Ikari's doing.

234
00:12:06,740 --> 00:12:08,660
Why did you stop here?

235
00:12:11,330 --> 00:12:13,120
Yes?

236
00:12:15,920 --> 00:12:19,170
Traitor!

237
00:12:19,170 --> 00:12:21,670
Matching outfits yet again,
in this day and age?!

238
00:12:21,670 --> 00:12:23,880
I can't believe this!

239
00:12:23,880 --> 00:12:29,430
Well, Miss Misato said that Japanese start by
dressing the part, so she made us...

240
00:12:30,560 --> 00:12:32,600
That's filthy, you two!

241
00:12:32,600 --> 00:12:34,440
You're wrong! You're wrong!

242
00:12:34,440 --> 00:12:36,060
Two wrongs don't make a right!

243
00:12:36,060 --> 00:12:37,650
Oh, welcome everybody!

244
00:12:39,070 --> 00:12:41,490
Could ya please explain
what all this's about?

245
00:12:43,400 --> 00:12:46,530
You shoulda told us that to begin with.

246
00:12:46,530 --> 00:12:49,200
So how is the coordination coming?

247
00:12:49,200 --> 00:12:51,450
Well, as you can see...

248
00:12:55,790 --> 00:12:57,330
Are you surprised?!

249
00:12:57,330 --> 00:13:01,210
There's no way I could possibly lower myself
to Shinji's level!

250
00:13:01,210 --> 00:13:03,550
It's just an utterly impossible idea!

251
00:13:03,550 --> 00:13:05,970
Then you give up?

252
00:13:05,970 --> 00:13:07,840
You don't have anyone else, do you?

253
00:13:09,050 --> 00:13:10,100
Rei?

254
00:13:10,100 --> 00:13:10,720
Yes, Ma'am.

255
00:13:10,720 --> 00:13:11,890
Why don't you try?

256
00:13:11,890 --> 00:13:13,140
Yes, Ma'am.

257
00:13:24,030 --> 00:13:27,610
It looks like I should alter the
operation to pair Shinji and Rei.

258
00:13:32,870 --> 00:13:35,660
No! I can't stand this! I've had enough!

259
00:13:39,290 --> 00:13:39,790
Asuka!

260
00:13:39,790 --> 00:13:41,960
Even the Devil cries sometimes.

261
00:13:41,960 --> 00:13:45,220
Ikari!

262
00:13:47,380 --> 00:13:49,050
Go after her!

263
00:13:49,590 --> 00:13:52,970
You made a girl cry! Take responsibility!

264
00:14:01,440 --> 00:14:02,020
Well...

265
00:14:02,020 --> 00:14:03,610
Don't say anything.

266
00:14:08,030 --> 00:14:09,610
I know.

267
00:14:09,610 --> 00:14:11,780
I have no choice but to pilot the Eva.

268
00:14:14,660 --> 00:14:16,370
I'll do it.

269
00:14:17,710 --> 00:14:21,630
Since it's come to this, I'll show up
both Rei and Misato!

270
00:14:21,630 --> 00:14:23,880
You don't have to show them up or anything.

271
00:14:23,880 --> 00:14:27,340
You're being too easy on them!
You're a man, aren't you?!

272
00:14:27,510 --> 00:14:29,680
For their attack...

273
00:14:29,680 --> 00:14:31,140
on my pride...

274
00:14:31,140 --> 00:14:33,930
I'll pay them back ten times over!

275
00:14:45,110 --> 00:14:45,860
TWO
MORE
DAYS

276
00:15:06,250 --> 00:15:09,380
ATTACK
TOMORROW

277
00:15:14,350 --> 00:15:15,430
Where's Misato?

278
00:15:15,430 --> 00:15:18,890
At work. She called earlier.
She'll be there all night.

279
00:15:19,390 --> 00:15:22,270
So that means we're all alone tonight.

280
00:15:34,950 --> 00:15:38,200
This is the impenetrable Wall of Jericho.

281
00:15:39,620 --> 00:15:42,620
Take one step over this wall
and you're a dead man.

282
00:15:42,620 --> 00:15:45,130
And now, it's time for children to go to bed!

283
00:15:46,710 --> 00:15:50,880
How can the Japanese sleep on the floor?
I can't believe it.

284
00:16:58,410 --> 00:17:00,120
Mama...

285
00:17:01,290 --> 00:17:03,000
Mama...

286
00:17:13,050 --> 00:17:15,340
You're just a child yourself.

287
00:17:16,510 --> 00:17:18,220
No, somebody will see us.

288
00:17:18,220 --> 00:17:18,850
Who's watching?

289
00:17:18,850 --> 00:17:20,430
Someb...

290
00:17:42,040 --> 00:17:44,910
Honestly! There's nothing
between us anymore.

291
00:17:44,910 --> 00:17:46,540
Don't do that again.

292
00:17:46,540 --> 00:17:49,630
But your lips didn't say no.

293
00:17:51,040 --> 00:17:53,920
Your lips or your words...

294
00:17:53,920 --> 00:17:56,010
Which one should I trust?

295
00:18:17,240 --> 00:18:19,110
There you go.

296
00:18:19,110 --> 00:18:20,530
Thanks.

297
00:18:20,530 --> 00:18:22,370
You're unusually sober today.

298
00:18:22,370 --> 00:18:24,870
Yeah, a little.

299
00:18:24,870 --> 00:18:27,580
Work? Or a man?

300
00:18:27,870 --> 00:18:29,540
A lot of things.

301
00:18:30,710 --> 00:18:32,750
Still in love?

302
00:18:33,550 --> 00:18:35,630
Don't say weird stuff like that!

303
00:18:35,630 --> 00:18:37,550
Who'd want that jerk?!

304
00:18:38,970 --> 00:18:41,260
It may have been a youthful indiscretion,

305
00:18:41,260 --> 00:18:45,270
but I can't believe I was dating a jerk like him.
It's the biggest blemish on my life.

306
00:18:45,720 --> 00:18:49,640
I meant that he may still like you.
Did I scare you?

307
00:18:49,640 --> 00:18:50,980
Why you lousy...

308
00:18:50,980 --> 00:18:52,810
Getting angry only shows I hit a sore spot.

309
00:18:53,820 --> 00:18:56,480
Why not be more honest with
your feelings this time?

310
00:18:56,480 --> 00:18:58,740
Things are different than eight years ago.

311
00:18:58,740 --> 00:19:02,490
It hasn't changed. Not a bit.
Still too immature.

312
00:19:03,410 --> 00:19:08,330
Well, I've got to get to work.
Tomorrow is the big day.

313
00:19:19,340 --> 00:19:22,680
Target has broken through
the final defense line at Gora.

314
00:19:22,680 --> 00:19:24,350
Here it comes!

315
00:19:24,350 --> 00:19:26,310
We won't fail this time!

316
00:19:26,310 --> 00:19:29,390
Deploy your AT fields as soon
as the music starts.

317
00:19:29,390 --> 00:19:30,890
Then stick to the operation.

318
00:19:30,890 --> 00:19:32,810
Got it, you two?

319
00:19:32,810 --> 00:19:34,360
Roger!

320
00:19:34,360 --> 00:19:36,570
The target has entered the mountains.

321
00:19:36,570 --> 00:19:40,320
Full power, maximum speed
from the start, got it?

322
00:19:40,320 --> 00:19:43,490
I know that. We'll finish in sixty-two seconds.

323
00:19:43,490 --> 00:19:46,120
Target entering Ground Zero.

324
00:19:46,120 --> 00:19:47,620
Detach external power cables.

325
00:19:49,620 --> 00:19:50,330
Launch.

326
00:19:51,080 --> 00:19:53,370
Time remaining

327
00:21:03,320 --> 00:21:05,150
Both Evas confirmed operational.

328
00:21:07,780 --> 00:21:09,700
Geez...

329
00:21:09,700 --> 00:21:10,450
This is pathetic.

330
00:21:15,370 --> 00:21:18,750
You jerk! How dare you do that
to my Unit 02?!

331
00:21:18,750 --> 00:21:21,670
What are you talking about?
You're the one who fell on me!

332
00:21:21,670 --> 00:21:24,800
You're the one who lost his timing first!

333
00:21:24,800 --> 00:21:26,800
It's because you're always so out of it!

334
00:21:26,800 --> 00:21:29,260
What were you doing, staying up
so late last night?!

335
00:21:29,260 --> 00:21:32,680
Image training for today's battle!

336
00:21:32,680 --> 00:21:36,390
Liar! I know you tried to kiss me
while I was sleeping!

337
00:21:36,390 --> 00:21:38,940
No fair! You were awake?!

338
00:21:38,940 --> 00:21:43,530
That's awful! I was just kidding,
but it was real?! You kissed me?!

339
00:21:43,530 --> 00:21:46,070
No, I didn't! I stopped!

340
00:21:46,070 --> 00:21:48,450
Pervert! Lech! Fiend! I can't believe you!

341
00:21:48,450 --> 00:21:53,290
It's because you talk in your sleep
and toss and turn so much!

342
00:21:54,540 --> 00:21:56,830
Those kids are embarrassing us again.

343
00:21:56,870 --> 00:21:59,830
TO BE CONTINUED

344
00:23:05,270 --> 00:23:06,110
PREVIEW

345
00:23:06,320 --> 00:23:09,240
The crater of Mount Asama where
an unhatched Angel lies.

346
00:23:09,240 --> 00:23:11,700
Nerv attempts the first capture of an Angel.

347
00:23:11,700 --> 00:23:15,120
A specially-equipped Eva Unit 02
challenges the fires of Hell!

348
00:23:15,120 --> 00:23:17,410
Next episode: "Magma Diver"

349
00:23:17,410 --> 00:23:18,870
And I'll give you more fan service next time!

350
00:23:17,660 --> 00:23:20,290
Magma Diver
